"A BN4 Navi's companion's sprite +1 (+0x91), the first kind's type his recipe moves (FireMan's 0x57, its role told by its type, tools/xdiff_snap.py T1_MOVED): its init (BN4 0x080CC3F8, called by FireMan's init at his spawn, in the battle's paused opening) sets its animation up (0x08002E10 at 0x080CC420) and runs the sprite update once (0x0800285C at 0x080CC428); from then each run of its mode 0 (0x080CC4D4) ends in 0x080CC5D0, which runs the after-step (BN4 0x080143FC, at 0x080CC5E8) unless time is stopped (0x08007948). Its copy in BN6 calls the twins (BN6 0x0801BBAC and 0x0800A098, tools/bn4_twins.py), whose pause tests (BN4 0x080078EC, BN6 0x0800A03C) skip the sprite update in the paused opening and run it at every fight frame: the count from its opening animation runs by the fight's frames, as the Navi's own (opening_count). In fireman_v1 it reads 2 at t1 in BN4 and at BN6's t1, 1 at BN6's t2; compared at the same fight frame for BN4's t1 and t2 alone (tools/xdiff_bn4.py companion_count). The animation it copies from its Navi's +0x10 each frame (0x080CC472-0x080CC478) from his first state's on (BN4's t2, BN6's t3) is a state's, compared with the battle's offset"
